,'2026-01-14 11:46:42','2026-01-14 11:46:42',NULL,1,NULL,'Costs incurred due to dental treatment arising due to an accident are covered under mediclaim insurance. \n                                   Some plans may offer costs incurred due to root canal or other such surgeries. Tooth extraction or \n                                   cosmatic Dental Treatment is not covered under mediclaim.','8',NULL,NULL),(159,'Dental Cover Amount Payable','Enter Dental Cover Amount Payable',1,4,0,'2026-01-14 11:46:42','2026-01-14 11:46:42',NULL,0,NULL,'','8',NULL,NULL),(160,'Critical illness Benefit','',4,4,0,'2026-01-14 11:46:42','2026-01-14 11:46:42',NULL,1,NULL,'This is a supplementary benefit where the patient after being diagnosed with a dreadful listed disease \n                                   has to survive a limited period (Mostly 30 days). Thereafter he/she is paid a lumpsum amount of \n                                   treatment as per his/her convenience. The list of diseases vary from company to company the most \n                                   common are cancer, Stroke, Heart attack, Coronary bypass surgery, Multiple organ failure etc..','9',NULL,NULL),(161,'Critical illness Amount Payable','Enter Critical illness Amount Payable',1,4,0,'2026-01-14 11:46:42','2026-01-14 11:46:42',NULL,0,NULL,'','9',NULL,NULL),(162,'Worldwide Emergency Cover','',4,4,0,'2026-01-14 11:46:42','2026-01-14 11:46:42',NULL,1,NULL,'Under this benefit the insurance policy will cover expenses incurred overseas owing to a unforsean\n                                   health condition. Traditionally mediclaim insurance would not cover medical expenses if incurred \n                                   outside indian borders, However now some insurers offer this feature as an addon benefit.','10',NULL,NULL),(163,'Worldwide Emergency Amount Payable','Enter Worldwide Emergency Amount Payable',1,4,0,'2026-01-14 11:46:42','2026-01-14 11:46:42',NULL,0,NULL,'','10',NULL,NULL),(164,'Amount Deductible